    <content type="html">&lt;details open=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;tts : forward -t to the mtmd context (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6512275239&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/32664&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/32664/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/32664&quot;&gt;#32664&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;llama-tts built the mtmd context from mtmd_context_params_default(), which hardcodes 4 threads, and never copied n_threads over, so -t never reach the mtmd side.&lt;br&gt;
Copy params.cpuparams.n_threads into mtmd_params.n_threads, as mtmd-cli and the server do; with no -t this now follows the resolved default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verified: -t 1 now runs single-threaded, -t 4 is unchanged, and the produced WAV is identical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assisted-by: Claude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
